Replacing API totals with a single frontend aggregation of all declarations would make reconciliation automatic, but loses the current server-authoritative total contract and breaks deliberately independent server-total tests. The local model should acknowledge the two authoritative inputs: server totals for aggregate values, full declarations for dates absent from summary.

